45	  // Gemini has the same practical alternation expectation for contents. When a
46	  // long transcript ending in the newest user prompt is sliced to an even-sized
47	  // window, the first retained turn can be the prior assistant response. Drop
48	  // any leading assistant-only context so every provider receives a valid
49	  // user-started transcript.
